                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love this game. I'm about 7 duels into it and I've killed a few bosses. At first I thought it was a standard draw and shoot game but it turns out to be MUCH more. To beat most of the opponents you must figure out their attack style and that's where the puzzle solving element comes in. I don't want to spoil anything, but the story is not JUST a revenge story.\n\nAlso, when it does come down to draw and shoot faster than the opponent, You have to really be accurate. I had to get into \"the zone\" and focus which makes it WAY more immersive than a lot of VR games I've played.",
